  "description": "JOYSTAR Zinnia Girls' Bike - Sizes 14\" to 20\"\nLet her imagination roll with the JOYSTAR Zinnia Girls' Bike with Doll Bike Seat. Perfectly blending a chic pink aesthetic with a fun doll seat and white accessory bag, this bike is built for girls aged 3-9 to develop confidence and create lasting childhood memories.\n\nThe JOYSTAR Zinnia: Where playtime and pedaling come together.\n\nPerformance & Safety Engineering\n\"Engineered for safety and styled for fun, the Zinnia features a robust frame and a dual-brake system designed for a smooth transition to independent riding.\"\nSuperior Safety & Control\nThe JOYSTAR Zinnia is constructed with a high-tensile HI-TEN steel frame, offering premium durability for every sidewalk adventure. To ensure reliable stopping power, it utilizes a dual-braking system: a front caliper hand brake for precision and a rear coaster (pedal) brake for intuitive stopping.\n\nWide pneumatic tires and reliable brakes provide a stable, safe ride.\n\nKey Features & Benefits\n\nImagination-Ready: Every bike includes a rear doll seat so her favorite friend can ride along, plus a white handlebar bag for snacks and treasures.\n\nDual Braking System: Front hand brake and rear coaster brake provide maximum safety and skill building.\n\nFull Chain Guard: Keeps fingers safe and clothing clean from grease.\n\nGrows with Her: Features a quick-release adjustable seat and handlebars to accommodate growth spurts.\n\nQuick & Easy Assembly\nGet riding sooner! The JOYSTAR Zinnia arrives 85% pre-assembled. With the included tools and clear instructions, you can have her new favorite bike ready for the road in about 20 minutes.\n\nEasy Setup: Step-by-step assembly for the JOYSTAR Zinnia.\n\nSize Chart & Fit Guide\n\nSee It In Detail\n\nDetailed View: Explore the premium finish and accessories of the Zinnia.\n\nIncluded Accessories: Rear Doll Seat, White Handlebar Bag, Bell, and DIY Decals\n\nOur Guarantee\nJOYSTAR is committed to quality and your child's happiness. Our warranty is designed to give you total peace of mind:\n\nThe Frame (Lifetime): Guaranteed against faulty materials and workmanship for the original purchaser.\n\nComponents (2 Years): Handlebars, forks, and cranksets are covered for 2 years against manufacturing defects.",
